IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-17`

-- Tests of Article 17 (quality management system). Expected values are written from the text of Article 17 before the run.
-- args of the decision functions: date asked, the AI system, the circumstances, then the facts of the paragraph.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE


-- The thirteen aspects of Art 17(1), in the order of points (a) to (m), positional.
`P3 all thirteen aspects` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (a)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (b)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (c)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (d)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (e)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (f)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (g)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (h)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (i)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (j)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (k)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (l)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 aspects without (m)` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE


§ `Art 17(1): at least the aspects (a) to (m): each is needed`

#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 all thirteen aspects`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (a)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (b)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (c)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (d)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (e)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (f)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (g)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (h)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (i)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (j)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (k)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (l)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(1) the quality management system includes at least the aspects listed in points (a) to (m)` `P3 aspects without (m)`)

§ `Art 17(1): the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1`

-- args: ensures compliance; documented systematically in writing; the aspects
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 aspects without (g)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(13): for an Article 6(1) system whose Section A legislation gives equivalent protection, the application of Article 17 may be limited: not covered (the delegated acts are outside the text).
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(2): cut off for Section B products.
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 system that is not high-risk` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 all thirteen aspects` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 17(2): each text in its own function; the dispatcher on the date asked`

-- args: the implementation is proportionate to the size of the organisation; the provider respects the degree of rigour and the level of protection.
-- The text as enacted, through its own function (the dispatcher never reaches it: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply only after 27 July 2026).
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) as amended the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(2) as amended the provider has met paragraph 2` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 17(2) as amended the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE FALSE)
-- The Omnibus adds the SME and SMC emphasis and changes no answer: both versions agree on every combination of the two facts.
#ASSERT (`Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS (`Art 17(2) as amended the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT (`Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS (`Art 17(2) as amended the provider has met paragraph 2` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT (`Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` FALSE TRUE) EQUALS (`Art 17(2) as amended the provider has met paragraph 2` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT (`Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` FALSE FALSE) EQUALS (`Art 17(2) as amended the provider has met paragraph 2` FALSE FALSE)
-- The dispatcher: as amended from 27 July 2026, and Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from 2 December 2027 for an Annex III system.
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Each side of 27 July 2026: the version in force changes, and the dispatcher answers NOTHING on both because the group does not yet apply.
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 26 7 2026) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 27 7 2026) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(2) the provider has met paragraph 2` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 17(3): a permission for a provider subject to sectoral quality management obligations`

#ASSERT `Art 17(3) the provider may include the aspects listed in paragraph 1 as part of the quality management systems pursuant to sectoral Union law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not subject to such obligations: the grant does not speak (NOTHING-kind, limited by its own wording; ruling of 2026-11-12), never a JUST FALSE "may not".
#ASSERT `Art 17(3) the provider may include the aspects listed in paragraph 1 as part of the quality management systems pursuant to sectoral Union law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 17(3) the provider may include the aspects listed in paragraph 1 as part of the quality management systems pursuant to sectoral Union law` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 17(4): financial institutions, aspect by aspect`

-- args: the aspect by its letter; the provider is a financial institution subject to internal governance requirements; it complies with those rules
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "a" TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "f" TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "j" TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "m" TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The exception: points (g), (h), (i) are not deemed fulfilled, whatever the provider does (the text's own "with the exception of").
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "g" TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "h" TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "i" TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not such an institution, or not complying: the deeming does not operate (NOTHING-kind: limited by its own wording).
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "a" FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "a" TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A letter that is no aspect of paragraph 1 (the paragraph has (a) to (m)): not covered.
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "n" TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the obligation to put in place a quality management system is deemed to be fulfilled as to the aspect` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` "a" TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The second sentence: harmonised standards referred to in Article 40 are taken into account.
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the harmonised standards referred to in Article 40 have been taken into account` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the harmonised standards referred to in Article 40 have been taken into account` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 17(4) the harmonised standards referred to in Article 40 have been taken into account` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Traces: a MUST or MAY with no time limit and no stated consequence reaches no BREACH`

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 17(1) the provider's duty to put a quality management system in place` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 17(1) put a quality management system in place that ensures compliance with this Regulation` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 17(1) the provider's duty to put a quality management system in place` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 17(1) the provider's duty to put a quality management system in place` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 17(2) the provider's duty to implement the aspects proportionately to the size of its organisation` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 17(2) implement the aspects referred to in paragraph 1 proportionately to the size of the provider's organisation` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 17(2) the provider's duty to respect the degree of rigour and the level of protection` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 17(2) respect the degree of rigour and the level of protection required to ensure the compliance of the high-risk AI systems with this Regulation` AT 5
-- Art 2(13) limits Article 17 for this system: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 17(2) the provider's duty to implement the aspects proportionately to the size of its organisation` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- The permission of paragraph 3: used, or not, it is FULFILLED; with no sectoral obligation nothing is permitted or owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 17(3) the provider's permission to include the aspects as part of the quality management systems pursuant to sectoral Union law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 17(3) include the aspects listed in paragraph 1 as part of the quality management systems pursuant to sectoral Union law` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 17(3) the provider's permission to include the aspects as part of the quality management systems pursuant to sectoral Union law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
